# The checks that read the folder the application is set to. They print real
# paths out of a real photo collection, so they stay on the machine they were
# written on. Nothing in the repository needs them: they are behind the `local`
# feature, which is off, and CI never turns it on.
/local/
/imgdedupe
/imgdedupe.exe
/imgdedupe-new
/imgdedupe-new.exe
